{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1793470737,"nonce":"foh/aMWboCSMAWt4HNwUwKZr60c=","title":"cn: port ashui's NumberGauge and NumberRangeGauge (a number over a range)","message":"Blinc has cn::slider and cn::number_input but nothing that shows a number as a filled range. ashui's NumberGauge and NumberRangeGauge are the spec.\n\nSources: ashui/components/haxe/ashui/components/{NumberGauge,NumberRangeGauge,NumberGaugeSizing}.hx, ashui/haxe/ashui/input/NumberWheel.hx, rules at components.css \"Filled numeric gauges\".\n\nNumberGauge: a range input rendered as a fill (primary 22% mixed into input-bg), a rest, a grip at the fill edge (11px wide, a six-dot SVG, primary 30% mix, 44% on hover/active/drag/focus), and the formatted value centred over it (pointer-events none). Bordered 1px (--border, --border-hover on hover), radius-default, height 24/32/40 for sm/md/lg, font 12/13/14, cursor ew-resize, focus-visible ring 2px. Disabled: tertiary text, fill input-bg-disabled, grip border-secondary.\nBehaviour: drag the fill edge, scroll anywhere (NumberWheel), arrows, Page Up/Down, Home/End; values snap to step from min; onChange reports user edits only; width derived from the formatted min/max/step in the current font (does not change with the value), narrower parents may shrink it.\n\nNumberRangeGauge: two such inputs stacked, lower covering only the prefix; pointer and wheel choose the nearest edge, Tab reaches each endpoint, coincident edges alternate on press, endpoints cannot cross. Format takes (lower, upper).\n\nShape of the port: a cn component over blinc_layout, one element with data-size, data-state=\"dragging\", :hover/:active/:focus/:disabled rules, shadow/radius/duration/ease tokens (no literal values), and a headless snapshot test per state. Reuse the slider's drag and keyboard handling rather than a second implementation. Needs :focus-visible for the keyboard ring, which is the pending input-modality work in e4d2db3.\n\nRelated: e4d2db3.","files":null}]}